#
# hyphaed/phases/postinstall.py::_check_apparmor_userns() installs a
# systemd drop-in as an immediate, no-rebuild stopgap for kernels already
# built without this hunk; this patch is the actual fix for the next build.
../custom/0028-apparmor-userns-sfs-advertise.patch

